@TodoList_Modern_HostAddress = http://localhost:5188
@TodoId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create a task
POST {{TodoList_Modern_HostAddress}}/api/v1/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy groceries"
}

### Complete a task (replace TodoId with the ID returned by the create request)
POST {{TodoList_Modern_HostAddress}}/api/v1/todos/{{TodoId}}/complete

### Cancel a task (replace TodoId with the ID returned by the create request)
POST {{TodoList_Modern_HostAddress}}/api/v1/todos/{{TodoId}}/cancel
